  "ruleText": "Saf-C 509.05 as Saf-C 510.05.\n\n#6282, effective 7-9-96\n\n#6795, effective 8-1-98\n\n#7069, effective 8-5-99\n\n#7431, effective 1-24-01\n\n#7898, INTERIM, effective 5-28-03\n\n#7972, effective 10-17-03\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #13521, effective 1-13-23, adopted, repealed, readopted, or readopted with amendments all of the rules in Chapter Saf-C 500. These changes included extensive renumbering of most of the existing rules within Chapter Saf-C 500 as indicated in the source notes. Document #13521 replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Chapter Saf-C 500.\n\nDocument #13521 adopted the following rules:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
